{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>46歲名模熊黛林與郭可頌迎來結婚10周年，兩人近日北上自駕遊慶祝卻意外引發婚姻震撼彈。兩夫妻在車廂內甜蜜討論一對雙胞胎女兒未來升學安排時，竟因男方一個承諾令女方當場嚇呆。這場原本浪漫的周年旅行瞬間演變成夫妻二人面臨「分居」危機的嚴峻考驗。</p>\n<h2>熊黛林與郭可頌車廂內討論女兒升學問題</h2>\n<p>郭可頌為了𠱁愛妻開心，特意精心策劃這場北上自駕遊之旅，出發時更貼心準備大袋零食及飲品。男方一邊親自駕駛一邊高唱經典情歌《分分鐘需要你》，氣氛原本相當溫馨。不過兩人在飯後繼續車程時談起兩名女兒將來出外讀書安排，熊黛林主動向丈夫提議由男方親自前往當地照顧女兒，自己則選擇留在原地。</p>\n<h2>郭可頌答應提議令熊黛林驚覺面臨分居危機</h2>\n<p>面對太太提出分隔兩地照顧女兒的要求，郭可頌當下一口答應並指自己毫不介意，更表示夫妻屆時可以不時互相探望。熊黛林聽後隨即睜大雙眼並驚訝反問自己是否不用前往，隨後直指這種久不久見一面的生活狀態等同「分居」。眼見太太陷入負面情緒，郭可頌馬上反問為何想法如此負面，隨即出手緊緊握住女方雙手給予安全感，並霸氣向女方承諾只要拖住手就不會分開，同時邀請女方陪他一同前往，成功化解這場誤會。</p>\n<h2>熊黛林婚後誕下雙胞胎女兒曾短暫淡出幕前</h2>\n<p>現年46歲熊黛林於2016年與郭可頌正式步入婚姻殿堂，婚後順利誕下一對雙胞胎女兒，一家四口生活一直保持和睦。她在婚後初期曾經短暫減少公開露面，專心擔任全職家庭主婦照顧兩名千金。直到近年她開始積極重返幕前工作，不但頻繁接拍各大內地綜藝節目，更頻頻現身直播間進行帶貨工作，努力兼顧事業與家庭發展。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚郭可頌舉動貼心成功保護十年婚姻</h2>\n<p>相關影片曝光後迅速在網絡上引發廣泛討論，不少網民對於這對夫妻結婚10年依然保持甜蜜互動表示羨慕。有網民留言大讚男方處理危機的手法十分成熟，直指「郭可頌真係好顧家又寵妻」、「一個動作就畀到十足安全感」。同時亦有人認為兩人為女兒升學未雨綢繆展現出負責任態度，評論寫道「做父母真係唔容易，連結婚周年都要牽掛住仔女升學」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1793611266802987_12356912916ae8560320599.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"vPO1T0_mivS6S5i90iJfk778-4MdSpB7Dmj-dw5o_nc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1793611266802987_12356912916ae8560320599.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361126968825547_7635838076ae85605ddfeb.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-02 下午5.17.17.png/1904x1974_q90.png\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361126968825547_7635838076ae85605ddfeb.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361128165497472_7152514656ae856120acb8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"DbkdHqcBivlr42CpN9kRJ9WkTpsnDcZfSwM6wEsDOsA.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361128165497472_7152514656ae856120acb8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361128361413873_17166197296ae85613ca208.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"eIWpYjK08QdYJWoQg5O9daSX8211XVmPTn-8l05_vJc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361128361413873_17166197296ae85613ca208.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/lynnx1010_1760066127_3740028206922752800_652653955_167591256368eccf88dd910-1024x1362.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"熊黛林 郭可頌 （圖片來源：IG@lynnx1010）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/lynnx1010_1760066127_3740028206922752800_652653955_167591256368eccf88dd910-1024x1362.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lynnx1010）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/lynnx1010_1760066127_3740028207216337841_652653955_211449598068eccf868b8ea-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"熊黛林 郭可頌 （圖片來源：IG@lynnx1010）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/lynnx1010_1760066127_3740028207216337841_652653955_211449598068eccf868b8ea-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lynnx1010）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/zafqz8tj4x0mno2h7vcowcadht6deuugjdqdvow0hvy_69906014368c90bd4100d9.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"熊黛林 自爆 （圖片來源：熊黛林抖音）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/zafqz8tj4x0mno2h7vcowcadht6deuugjdqdvow0hvy_69906014368c90bd4100d9.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：熊黛林抖音）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:22.249721+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1141,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T09:21:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T10:59:05.484200+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:38:44.739224+00:00","content_hash":"77a031073da388a30cd00503acfda4cc1690011b79a9f648657680877f198c03","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}